--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- chain with a clump weight at a Free line end, dynamic run
-- A single chain hangs from a fairlead at the surface down to a heavy clump weight modelled as a
-- Free point (a 1-line terminal): Mass 20 t, Vol 1 m^3, so a net downward load (Mass - rhoW*Vol)*g
-- pulls the line end down and sets the pretension. Free points carry Mass/Vol only on the dynamic
-- point-system path, so the deck sets dtM/TMax; the static IC seeds the march, held here for 2 s.
-- Chain: R4 studless 155 mm, volume-equivalent diam 0.2791 m, dry mass 480.93 kg/m, EA 2.058e9 N.
